            "source:d9590184650917d96ab32b84",
            "source:de00f2110cd4e10c0044c506",
            "source:90c033ae61dcee3231a85739"
          ],
          "text": "Krik'thir the Gatewatcher is a named commander who invokes Anub'arak's command and claims the kingdom for the Scourge. He calls the swarming creatures his pets and says they hunger. In defeat, he reflects that he has lost the capacity to feel grateful, suggesting a trace of regret beneath his hostility.",
